From d00649dc8be0bc2874c253099bc49fc3f3586afb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Muse <muse@local>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 01:48:36 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(infra): migrate FirebirdPriceBoardRepository to
 Dapper

Replace hand-written ADO.NET boilerplate (FbCommand + reader loop +
positional column mapping) with Dapper QueryAsync/ExecuteAsync/
ExecuteScalarAsync. SQL statements kept 100% identical; only column
aliases added (e.g. COMPANY_ID AS CompanyId) since Dapper maps by name.

- Add Dapper 2.1.89 package reference to Kazuko.Infrastructure
- Keep FirebirdDatabase.CreateConnection() and explicit FbTransaction handling
- Public IPriceBoardRepository signatures unchanged
- Verified: dotnet build succeeds with 0 warnings/errors
---
 .../Kazuko.Infrastructure.csproj              |   1 +
 .../FirebirdPriceBoardRepository.cs           | 487 +++++++++---------
 2 files changed, 231 insertions(+), 257 deletions(-)

